BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:agistri-metochi-panigiri-of-panagia-15-august-metochi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia (15 August)\, Metochi
LOCATION:Metochi\, Agistri\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The little church of Panagia in the hamlet of Metochi above Megalochori has the island's Dekapentavgoustos celebration\, reached on foot along the trail\; the whole island turns out and the tavernas in Megalochori take the overflow. Book a room for that weekend\, Agistri fills with Athenians.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/agistri/#metochi-panigiri-of-panagia-15-august-metochi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/agistri/#metochi-panigiri-of-panagia-15-august-metochi
END:VEVENT
